<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Meet Me In The Pale Moonlight</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Echo Blaze</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Meet Me In The Pale Moonlight</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">37AER0fyiOzVNmWWlPvqTG</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.040" end="00:21.040">Understand this, I'm not looking for true love tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.980" end="00:26.640">If you wanna be my little baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.640" end="00:33.200">You can meet me in the pale moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.200" end="00:35.820">I been workin' every day 8 to 9</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.820" end="00:38.230">And serving coke and fries at the movie blue drive-in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.230" end="00:43.880">If you want me, you know where to find me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.880" end="00:49.170">I can be your one time baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.170" end="00:54.160">I can be your little dairy queen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.160" end="00:59.490">I don't wanna care tonight, I don't wanna fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.490" end="01:03.430">You don't have to give me everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.430" end="01:09.570">Just put your sweet kiss, kiss on my lips now, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.570" end="01:17.570" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.580" end="01:26.580">Understand this, I been likin' you since I was small</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.560" end="01:31.760">I don't wanna get you runnin' scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.760" end="01:38.630">When there's no pressure there at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.630" end="01:41.060">I been workin' 8 to 9 every day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.060" end="01:43.940">And think about you almost all the time, all the time and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.940" end="01:49.410">If I wanna see you, I drive by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.410" end="01:54.560">I can be your one time baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.560" end="01:59.570">I can be your little dairy queen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.570" end="02:04.810">I don't wanna care tonight, I don't wanna fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.810" end="02:08.780">You don't have to give me everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.780" end="02:13.550">Just put your sweet kiss, kiss on my lips now, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.550" end="02:21.550">I'm the sweetest girl in town so why are you so mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.310" end="02:28.130">When you gonna ditch that stupid, you got?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.130" end="02:33.420">It's me you should be seein'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.420" end="02:39.270">Hello-o-o, you are lookin' so fine, so fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.270" end="02:44.100">Fantasy about you is like a gold mine, gold mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.100" end="02:49.590">Askin' everybody, "Is he mine? Is he mine?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.590" end="02:51.990">Not quite yet, but I'm gonna get-get him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.990" end="02:54.820">Not quite yet, but I'm gonna get-get him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.820" end="03:00.130">I can be your one time baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.130" end="03:05.190">I can be your little dairy queen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.190" end="03:10.560">I don't wanna care tonight, I don't wanna fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.560" end="03:14.240">You don't have to give me everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.240" end="03:18.900">Just put your sweet kiss, kiss on my lips now, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.900" end="03:22.900" /></div></body></tt>